>> To say that something is salty is to assert that it tastes like salt (NaCl
>> and friends).  It is not necessary to create a special word for it.
>>
>>               --gejyspa
>>
>>
>>
>> On Fri, Jan 10, 2014 at 1:45 AM, Gleki Arxokuna <
